Third-party notices
===================

This repository does not redistribute any third-party corpus or dictionary.

- Financial statement data is derived from annual reports published on
  CNINFO (http://www.cninfo.com.cn), China's statutory disclosure venue for
  listed-company filings. Source PDFs are not committed to this repository;
  extracted values carry the SHA-256 of the PDF they came from.
- AKShare (https://github.com/akfamily/akshare, MIT) is used only as an
  optional cross-check source, never as the authoritative one.
- pdfplumber (MIT) is the PDF text/table layer. This project deliberately
  avoids AGPL-licensed PDF components; see DECISIONS.md D-014.
